      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this works when the device\u0027s inventory object has configured_by\nto the same configuration object as the SPDM record, as for an SMA.\n\nHow would it work when EM creates the device itself? For ex, CPU_0\nis a configuration of its own\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96744\nand its MCTP record VR_C2_MCTP_USB_CPU0 names P5035_C2_HPM in Board\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96747\n\nThe SPDM record for it would be on the HPM board, with no configures to\nCPU_0.\n\nProtectedBoards can name CPU_0, but how would integrated_into find it\nwithout the array position?",
